The eBPF object of cmd/vmafx-node (rclonebypass_bpfel.o) is generated at build
time by scripts/dev/gen-node-bpf.sh (make node-bpf) and is not committed
(ADR-1622, docs/development/node-ebpf-build.md). This file stays so that the
go:embed pattern "rclonebypass_bpfel.o*" in object_embed.go matches a file on a
checkout that has not generated the object.
